# A planted ledger: each runtime symbol of the planted configuration, with its mark.
format 1
rule artifact-symbols
configuration planted kind planted
configuration planted tier planted
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_abort | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_acquire | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __cxa_guard_release | -
@build/libcrucible.a | allow | 1 | __gxx_personality_v0 | -
@build/libcrucible.a | libc-allow | 1 | _Unwind_Resume | -
@build/libcrucible.a | libc-allow | 1 | memcpy | -
@build/libcrucible.a | libc-ratchet | 1 | atexit | -
@build/libfoundation.a | ratchet | 1 | _ZNSt6thread20hardware_concurrencyEv | -
